# ─── Environment variable template ────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# INSTRUCTIONS:
#   1. Copy this file and rename the copy to ".env"  (remove the ".example" part)
#   2. Replace "your_key_here" below with your actual Gemini API key
#   3. Save the .env file — the script will read it automatically
#
# WHERE TO GET A FREE GEMINI API KEY:
#   1. Go to https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#   2. Sign in with your Google account
#   3. Click "Create API Key"
#   4. Copy the key and paste it below
#
# IMPORTANT: Never share your .env file or commit it to git.
#   The .gitignore in this project already excludes .env for you.
#

GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here
